---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PeriodMotif from '../../../components/PeriodMotif.astro';
---

<Layout title="Modernism Listening: Two Paths — Of Imagination All Compact">

<div class="ml-page">

<div class="ml-crumb">
  <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><a href="/units/05-modernism/music">Modernism</a><span class="sep">/</span><span class="here">Listening: Two Paths</span>
</div>

<div class="header-band" aria-hidden="true"><PeriodMotif unit="05-modernism" role={6} /></div>

<section class="page-head">
  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow">Shared Resource · Modernism</div>
    <h1>Modernism Listening: <em>Two Paths</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Two traditions, two different ways of reorganizing expectation. Listen for the pattern, the pressure, and the voice that changes what a pattern can do.</p>
    <div class="meta-row">Two dedicated listening paths · 7–10 minutes each · no music training needed</div>
  </div>
  <span class="page-sig" aria-hidden="true"><PeriodMotif unit="05-modernism" role={5} /></span>
</section>

<p class="threshold">Modernism did not have one sound. These two paths offer different listening tools for hearing structure, disruption, freedom, and voice — each organized around the same three listening threads you'll meet throughout the music units.</p>

<div class="section-terminator" aria-hidden="true"><PeriodMotif unit="05-modernism" role={3} /></div>

<nav class="path-selector" aria-label="Choose a listening path">
  <div class="path-box path-jazz">
    <span class="path-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 28 Q 21 18, 28 28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"></path><path d="M6 20 Q 13 10, 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".5"></path><circle cx="14" cy="28" r="1.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="28" cy="28" r="1.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle></svg></span>
    <div class="path-idx">01 · Structure, freedom, and voice</div>
    <h2 class="path-title">Blues &amp; Jazz</h2>
    <p class="path-invite">Hear a pulse that can lean, a call that can be answered, and a returning form that makes change audible.</p>
    <ul class="study-list">
      <li><span class="sn">01</span>Groove — Structure &amp; Freedom</li>
      <li><span class="sn">02</span>Dialogue — Texture &amp; Voices</li>
      <li><span class="sn">03</span>Chorus — Consonance &amp; Dissonance</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="path-cta" href="/guides/modernism-listening/blues-jazz">Begin: Blues &amp; Jazz →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="path-box path-modern">
    <span class="path-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"></circle><path d="M6 20 A 14 14 0 0 1 34 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"></path><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="28" y2="20" stroke-dasharray="2 2" stroke="currentColor"></line><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle></svg></span>
    <div class="path-idx">02 · Pattern, disruption, and changed expectation</div>
    <h2 class="path-title">Modernist Concert Music</h2>
    <p class="path-invite">Hear a pattern persist, a pulse come under pressure, a tonal center lose its hold, and color become structure.</p>
    <ul class="study-list">
      <li><span class="sn">01</span>Ostinato — Structure &amp; Freedom</li>
      <li><span class="sn">02</span>Collision — Texture &amp; Voices</li>
      <li><span class="sn">03</span>Color — Texture &amp; Voices</li>
      <li><span class="sn">04</span>Center — Consonance &amp; Dissonance</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="path-cta" href="/guides/modernism-listening/modernist-concert">Begin: Modernist Concert Music →</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="exit">
  <h2>Carry the listening into Modernism</h2>
  <div class="crosswalk">
    <div class="cw-head">Listening move</div><div></div><div class="cw-head">Reading move</div>
    <div class="cw-row"><div class="cw-listen">A pattern repeats under pressure</div><div class="cw-arrow">→</div><div class="cw-read">Repeated pressure on a fixed idea</div></div>
    <div class="cw-row"><div class="cw-listen">A call is answered by a contrasting voice</div><div class="cw-arrow">→</div><div class="cw-read">Answering voices in dialogue</div></div>
    <div class="cw-row"><div class="cw-listen">The same ground supports a different path</div><div class="cw-arrow">→</div><div class="cw-read">Return-with-change</div></div>
    <div class="cw-row"><div class="cw-listen">A pulse comes under pressure</div><div class="cw-arrow">→</div><div class="cw-read">Disruption of expectation</div></div>
    <div class="cw-row"><div class="cw-listen">The same material shifts color</div><div class="cw-arrow">→</div><div class="cw-read">Shifts of register or voice</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="exit-links">
    <a href="/units/05-modernism/music">Explore Modernism: Music</a>
    <a href="/guides/listening-studio">Return to The Elements — Hearing Music</a>
    <a href="/units/05-modernism">Invisible Man — novel context</a>
  </div>
</section>

<details class="design-notes">
  <summary>Design notes</summary>
  <p><strong>Two separate pages:</strong> Blues &amp; Jazz and Modernist Concert Music are full, independent pages, each with its own header motif, page signature, section terminator, and accent color — so each tradition reads as its own complete experience rather than a tab within a shared shell. This hub page is a pure, co-equal threshold: neither path is default or larger than the other. <strong>Shared organizing principle:</strong> both dedicated pages group their studies under the same three listening threads used across the music units — Structure &amp; Freedom, Texture &amp; Voices, Consonance &amp; Dissonance — using the identical thread glyphs from that system, recolored to each path's own accent. <strong>Motif sourcing:</strong> the Modernist Concert Music page reuses the site's real Modernism ornament system (header band, page signature, section terminator) in its established rust tone; Blues &amp; Jazz uses a parallel but distinct set of call-and-response arc motifs in the same structural roles, tinted in a comparable-weight smoky indigo — cousins, not lookalikes. <strong>Reduced motion:</strong> loading spinners are suppressed under prefers-reduced-motion; guide diagrams redraw on play/pause/seek rather than looping decoratively.</p>
</details>

<footer>
  <div>Of Imagination All Compact · AP Literature</div>
  <div>Shared Resource / Modernism Listening</div>
</footer>

</div>

</Layout>

<style>
.ml-page{--acc-jazz:#46566E;--acc-jazz-soft:color-mix(in oklab,#46566E 12%,white);--acc-modern:#A03828;--acc-modern-soft:color-mix(in oklab,#A03828 12%,white);--mark-primary:#A03828;--mark-highlight:#D49A8C;--mark-rule:#C8C0B0;--gutter:clamp(20px,4vw,72px);padding:0 var(--gutter);max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;line-height:1.6}
.ml-page a{color:var(--acc-modern);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-style:dotted;text-underline-offset:3px}
.ml-page a:hover{color:color-mix(in oklab,var(--acc-modern) 70%,black)}
.ml-page :focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:2px}
.ml-crumb{padding:20px 0 0;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.ml-crumb a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.ml-crumb a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.ml-crumb .sep{color:var(--rule-strong)}
.ml-crumb .here{color:var(--ink-mute)}
.header-band{width:calc(100% + 2 * var(--gutter));margin:18px calc(-1 * var(--gutter)) 0;color:var(--mark-primary)}
.header-band :global(svg){display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
.page-head{padding:22px 0 20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 72px;gap:24px;align-items:start}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--acc-modern);margin-bottom:10px}
.page-head h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,50px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--ink)}
.page-head h1 em{font-style:italic}
.lede{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:19px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink-mute);margin:0 0 14px;max-width:70ch}
.meta-row{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.page-sig{width:72px;height:72px;flex:0 0 72px;color:var(--mark-primary)}
.page-sig :global(svg){width:100%;height:100%}
.threshold{max-width:66ch;margin:28px 0 0;padding:18px 22px;border-left:3px solid var(--acc-modern);background:var(--bg-raised);font-family:var(--font-display);font-style:italic;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink)}
.section-terminator{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:40px 0;color:var(--mark-primary)}
.section-terminator :global(svg){height:58px;width:auto}

.path-selector{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0;border:1px solid var(--rule);margin-bottom:8px}
.path-selector .path-box:first-child{border-right:1px solid var(--rule)}
@media (max-width:820px){.path-selector{grid-template-columns:1fr}.path-selector .path-box:first-child{border-right:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}}
.path-box{--acc:var(--acc-jazz);--acc-soft:var(--acc-jazz-soft);padding:34px 36px;background:var(--bg-sunken);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.path-box.path-modern{--acc:var(--acc-modern);--acc-soft:var(--acc-modern-soft)}
.path-glyph{width:56px;height:56px;color:var(--acc);border:1px solid color-mix(in oklab,var(--acc) 45%,var(--rule-strong));background:var(--acc-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px}
.path-glyph svg{width:32px;height:32px}
.path-idx{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--acc);margin-bottom:10px}
.path-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:400;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 12px}
.path-invite{font-family:var(--font-display);font-style:italic;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink-mute);margin:0 0 20px;max-width:42ch}
.study-list{list-style:none;margin:0 0 26px;padding:0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font-family:var(--font-ui);font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-mute)}
.study-list li{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);display:flex;gap:12px}
.study-list .sn{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--acc)}
.path-cta{margin-top:auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 20px;background:var(--acc);color:var(--bg-sunken);font-family:var(--font-ui);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em;text-decoration:none;align-self:flex-start}
.path-cta:hover{background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--acc) 82%,black)}

.exit{max-width:78ch;margin:64px auto 0;padding-top:44px;border-top:2px solid var(--rule-strong)}
.exit h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:300;font-style:italic;font-size:30px;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 20px}
.crosswalk{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:10px 18px;margin-bottom:32px}
.crosswalk .cw-row{display:contents}
.crosswalk .cw-listen,.crosswalk .cw-read{font-family:var(--font-ui);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;padding:12px 14px;background:var(--bg-raised);border:1px solid var(--rule)}
.crosswalk .cw-arrow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--acc-modern);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:14px}
.crosswalk .cw-head{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);padding:0 14px 4px}
@media (max-width:640px){.crosswalk{grid-template-columns:1fr}.crosswalk .cw-arrow{justify-content:flex-start;padding-left:14px}}
.exit-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px}
.exit-links a{display:inline-block;padding:12px 18px;border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);font-family:var(--font-ui);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}
.exit-links a:hover{border-color:var(--acc-modern);color:var(--acc-modern);background:var(--acc-modern-soft)}

.design-notes{max-width:74ch;margin:40px auto 0}
.design-notes summary{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);cursor:pointer}
.design-notes[open] summary{margin-bottom:12px}
.design-notes p{font-family:var(--font-ui);font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-mute)}

footer{padding:40px 0 56px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:56px;font-family:var(--font-ui);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--ink-soft);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
</style>
